@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    ``wait.wait_exponential_jitter`` accepts a new ``min`` argument that sets a
+    floor on the wait, matching ``wait_exponential``. Its ``max``, ``jitter`` and
+    ``min`` arguments also accept ``datetime.timedelta`` values as well as
+    numbers of seconds.
